  "title": "Gió qua rèm",
  "about": "Round 33, ke-chuyen-gan (\"hãy tiếp tục sáng tác album mới, theo phong cách ambient và dễ ngủ\"), for a new album, Những giấc mơ nhỏ: wind through the curtain, F-sharp minor in 3/4 at 56 bpm. Its motif sways up to the seventh and back (C#-F#-E), as a curtain lifts and falls; the middle in A major; the violas' thin line under it. Written to sleep to, on the sound the user settled on (ke-chuyen-gan: the piano near, a wide hall, a soft echo): its tune moves by step and stays low, its sentences come back with small changes (each middle section 16 bars, a sentence and its variation), the left hand rocks in eighths through most of it, the climax stays low. An original tune.",
